== Notes and trivia ==
* "Zeth" roughly translates to "High Temple" in the old language of Corthan.<ref name=":0" />
* One of the runes in the Molten Core is called the Rune of Zeth; it is possible that the Lord of Everlasting Flame, the god worshiped by Zetharian followers, is Ragnaros.

