[[File:Ruins of Greyshire.png|thumb|right|300px]]
The '''Ruins of Greyshire''' are what remains of the town of '''Greyshire''', located in [[Gilneas]]. The town was ravaged and destroyed when a Scourge warhost led by the lich [[Naze the Eternal]] broke through the [[Greymane Wall]] at what is now known as [[Oldrock Pass]]. The Scourge were soundly defeated by the Royal Army and pushed out of Gilneas, but Greyshire was destroyed in the attack.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|42|Scouring Greyshire}}</ref> The town, as well as the neighboring [[Westgate Tower]], are now infested with the lingering undead remnants. The only remaining inhabitants are located at the [[Shademore Tavern]], located on the southern end of the village.

